+### Compound Format
+
+```ts
+ms(5400000, { compound: true })       // "1h 30m"
+ms(90061000, { compound: true })      // "1d 1h 1m 1s"
+ms(-5400000, { compound: true })      // "-1h 30m"
+```
+
+Parts are separated by a space, days are the largest unit and leftover
+milliseconds are dropped.
+
